    Values:
    - '<b>Barbarian</b>

      Value piece 4'
    - "<b>B\xE1rbaro</b>\nPe\xE7a de valor 4"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_bo_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Bomb</b>

      Kills any piece except the specialist'
    - "<b>Bomba</b>\nMata qualquer pe\xE7a menos o especialista"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_ca_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Captain</b>

      Value piece 8'
    - "<b>Capit\xE3o</b>\nPe\xE7a de valor 8"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_co_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Commander</b>

      Value piece 5'
    - "<b>Comandante</b>\nPe\xE7a de valor 5"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_es_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Engineer</b>

      Defuse enemy bombs'
    - '<b>Engenheiro</b>

      Desarma as bombas inimigas'
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_gu_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Warrior</b>

      Piece worth 3'
    - "<b>Guerreiro</b>\nPe\xE7a com valor 3"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_la_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Lanceman</b>

      Value piece 7'
    - "<b>Lanceiro</b>\nPe\xE7a de valor 7"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_re_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>King</b>

      Strongest piece of value 9'
    - "<b>Rei</b>\nPe\xE7a mais forte de valor 9"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_sm_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Swordsman </b>

      Value piece 6'
    - "<b>Espadachim </b>\nPe\xE7a de valor 6"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_so_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Private soldier</b>

      Walk up to 8 spaces vertically or horizontally'
    - "<b>Soldado raso</b>\nAnda at\xE9 8 casas na vertical ou na horizontal"
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_sp_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Assassin</b>

      The assassin manages to defeat the enemy king, but
      loses to any other soldier'
    - '<b>Assassino</b>

      O assassino consegue derrotar o rei inimigo, mas perde
      para qualquer outro soldado'
  - Key: project.assets.game.prefab.pieces_te_tooltip_bg_description
    Values:
    - '<b>Treasure</b>

      If the enemy finds your treasure you lose'
    - "<b>Tesouro</b>\nSe o inimigo encontrar seu tesouro voc\xEA perde"
